        "TileImage": "$($repository 48e64433-6930-4b27-832d-30b0df8f6878).Image",
        "Description": "It may be the holiday season, but Catherine Burlet and Martha Herris are not here for festivities. The two belong to a fringe traditionalist cult hell-bent on destroying non-believers who dare celebrate &quot;Christmas&quot; on &quot;Yule.&quot; We have uncovered a sinister plot to cause mass casualties in Paris, and our intel suggests that you have little time before that plan is put into action.\r\rEliminate the targets quickly, and escape with enough time to disarm their device in the city.",
